  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Final Day",
    "summary": "As your **[Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase)** ends, each of your **TYRANIDS** **SYNAPSE** units may pick one of your **GENESTEALER CULTS** units, other than a **PURESTRAIN GENESTEALER** or **PATRIARCH** unit, plus a TYRANIDS unit of yours, both visible to it and within 9\". The cult unit then takes D3+1 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**; one model in the chosen TYRANIDS unit recovers lost wounds up to the number inflicted, and until your next Movement phase starts that unit's models get +1 to Hit on their attacks. Your TYRANIDS units also have **Catalyst (Aura)**: friendly GENESTEALER CULTS units get +1 to Hit when attacking an enemy unit within 6\" of that TYRANIDS unit.",
